<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.30 points off FTSE, Jan 27.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.30 points off FTSE, Jan 27.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on January 27 and analysts estimate this will take 1.30 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * Associated British Foods	    5.25   6.563    0.341</p>
<p>    * Burton Group			    1.65   2.063    0.175</p>
<p>    * Scottish Power			  6.17   7.713    0.524</p>
<p>    * Tomkins				   3.06   3.825    0.264</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
